==================== Razorpay Sandbox Payment Flow Evidence ====================
Test Date: 2026-08-27
Commit: 51191b2acd9d5d77ab0f81100cb59a05ecf7575b
Environment: Local development with Razorpay Test Mode keys
Razorpay SDK: razorpay==1.4.2 (Python)

--- IMPORTANT: Scope & Limitations ---
All 42 payment tests below use a MOCKED Razorpay client.
No live or sandbox Razorpay API calls were made during this test run.

What IS verified:
  - Server-side payment logic (signature validation, idempotency, tampering
    detection, webhook handling, refund security, RBAC enforcement)
  - All Razorpay client interactions are mocked via unittest.mock

What is NOT verified:
  - End-to-end Razorpay sandbox checkout (creating a real test order via
    Razorpay Dashboard, completing payment in the test checkout page,
    verifying webhook delivery to the backend)
  - Real Razorpay API responses, latency, or error behavior

Recommendation:
  A full end-to-end Razorpay sandbox checkout should be performed before
  production deployment as a post-merge task.

